{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"xiahoucao-p0067","name":"朱讚","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o055"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xiahoucao-m-o055-xiahoucao-p0067","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o055"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o055","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-99dddb635fb85da856c7","layer":"original","quote":"真少与宗人曹遵、乡人朱讚并事太祖〖21〗。遵、讚早亡，真愍之；乞分所食邑，封遵、讚子。诏曰：“大司马有叔向抚孤之仁〖22〗，笃晏平久要之分〖23〗。君子成人之美：听分真邑，赐遵、讚子爵关内侯，各百户。”真每征行，与将士同劳苦；军赏不足，辄以家财班赐，士卒皆愿为用。真病还洛阳，帝自幸其第省疾。真薨，谥曰元侯。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":224,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":154}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
